#: ../../administration/provisioning/settings.rst:4
msgid "Provisioning Settings"
msgstr "Aprovisionamiento Configuración"

#: ../../administration/provisioning/settings.rst:7
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../administration/provisioning/settings.rst:9
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Provisioning Settings (:menuselection:`Administration --> Settings --> "
"Provisioning`) configure global defaults and behaviors for the |morpheus|"
" provisioning engine. These settings control the provisioning wizard "
"experience, default configurations, naming behavior, and infrastructure-"
"as-code settings."
msgstr ""
"Aprovisionamiento Configuración (|AdmSetPro|) configure global defaults y"
" behaviors para el |morpheus| aprovisionamiento engine. Estos "
"configuración control el aprovisionamiento wizard experience, "
"predeterminado configurations, naming behavior, y infraestructura-as-code"
" configuración."

#: ../../administration/provisioning/settings.rst:11
#: ../../administration/provisioning/settings.rst:57
msgid "Note"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/provisioning/settings.rst:11
msgid ""
"These settings apply appliance-wide (Master Tenant scope) or per-Tenant "
"(Account scope) depending on the specific setting."
msgstr ""
"Estos configuración aplicar appliance-wide (Inquilino maestro alcance) o "
"per-Inquilino (Cuenta alcance) dependiendo de el específico setting."

#: ../../administration/provisioning/settings.rst:14
msgid "Role Permissions"
msgstr "Rol Permisos"

#: ../../administration/provisioning/settings.rst:16
msgid ""
"**Administration: Provisioning Settings** with ``Full`` access is "
"required to modify provisioning settings"
msgstr ""
"**Administration: Provisioning Settings** con ``Full`` acceso es "
"obligatorio a modify aprovisionamiento configuración"

#: ../../administration/provisioning/settings.rst:19
msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "General Configuración"

#: ../../administration/provisioning/settings.rst:21
msgid "Allow Cloud Selection"
msgstr "Permitir Nube Selection"

#: ../../administration/provisioning/settings.rst:22
msgid ""
"When enabled, the Cloud selection dropdown is displayed in the "
"provisioning wizard. When disabled, the default Cloud is used "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"Cuando está habilitado, el Nube selection menú desplegable es mostrado en"
" el aprovisionamiento wizard. Cuando está deshabilitado, el "
"predeterminado Nube es usado automáticamente."

#: ../../administration/provisioning/settings.rst:24
msgid "Allow Host Selection"
msgstr "Permitir Host Selection"

#: ../../administration/provisioning/settings.rst:25
msgid ""
"When enabled, the Host selection dropdown is shown during provisioning. "
"When disabled, host selection is handled automatically by |morpheus| "
"placement logic."
msgstr ""
"Cuando está habilitado, el Host selection menú desplegable es shown "
"durante aprovisionamiento. Cuando está deshabilitado, host selection es "
"handled automáticamente por |morpheus| placement logic."

#: ../../administration/provisioning/settings.rst:27
msgid "Require Environment Selection"
msgstr "Requerir Entorno Selection"

#: ../../administration/provisioning/settings.rst:28
msgid ""
"When enabled, users must select an Environment (e.g., Development, "
"Staging, Production) during provisioning. Environments are configured in "
"|ProEnv|."
msgstr ""
"Cuando está habilitado, usuarios debe seleccionar un Entorno (e.g., "
"Development, Staging, Production) durante aprovisionamiento. Entornos son"
" configurado en |ProEnv|."

#: ../../administration/provisioning/settings.rst:30
msgid "Show Pricing"
msgstr "Show Pricing"

#: ../../administration/provisioning/settings.rst:31
msgid ""
"Controls visibility of pricing estimates in the provisioning wizard and "
"on Instance/Host detail pages."
msgstr ""
"Controla visibilidad de pricing estimates en el aprovisionamiento wizard "
"y en Instancia/Host detalle páginas."

#: ../../administration/provisioning/settings.rst:33
msgid "Hide Datastore Stats On Selection"
msgstr "Hide Datastore Stats En Selection"

#: ../../administration/provisioning/settings.rst:34
msgid ""
"When enabled, datastore utilization statistics and size information are "
"hidden in provisioning and app wizards."
msgstr ""
"Cuando está habilitado, datastore utilization statistics y size "
"information son hidden en aprovisionamiento y app wizards."

#: ../../administration/provisioning/settings.rst:36
msgid "Cross-Tenant Naming Policies"
msgstr "Cross-Inquilino Naming Políticas"

#: ../../administration/provisioning/settings.rst:37
msgid ""
"When enabled, the ``sequence`` value in naming policies applies globally "
"across all Tenants rather than per-Tenant. This prevents naming "
"collisions in shared infrastructure."
msgstr ""
"Cuando está habilitado, el ``sequence`` valor en naming políticas se "
"aplica globally a través de todos Inquilinos rather than per-Inquilino. "
"Este prevents naming collisions en shared infraestructura."

#: ../../administration/provisioning/settings.rst:39
msgid "Reuse Naming Sequence Numbers"
msgstr "Reuse Naming Sequence Numbers"

#: ../../administration/provisioning/settings.rst:40
msgid ""
"When enabled, sequence numbers are recycled when Instances are removed. "
"When disabled, |morpheus| tracks all issued sequence numbers and always "
"uses the next available number, preventing name reuse."
msgstr ""
"Cuando está habilitado, sequence numbers son recycled cuando Instancias "
"son removed. Cuando está deshabilitado, |morpheus| tracks todos issued "
"sequence numbers y always uses el next disponible número, preventing "
"nombre reuse."

#: ../../administration/provisioning/settings.rst:42
msgid "Deployment Archive Store"
msgstr "Deployment Archive Store"

#: ../../administration/provisioning/settings.rst:43
msgid ""
"Sets the default Storage Provider for storing deployment archives. "
"Storage Providers are configured in Infrastructure > Storage."
msgstr ""
"Sets el predeterminado Storage Provider para storing deployment archives."
" Storage Providers son configurado en Infraestructura > Storage."

#: ../../administration/provisioning/settings.rst:46
msgid "Cloud-Init Settings"
msgstr "Nube-Init Configuración"

#: ../../administration/provisioning/settings.rst:48
msgid ""
"|morpheus| can inject global users during provisioning. This requires "
"Cloud-Init (Linux), Cloudbase-Init (Windows), or VMware Tools on the "
"provisioned images."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| puede inject global usuarios durante aprovisionamiento. Este "
"requiere Nube-Init (Linux), Nubebase-Init (Windows), o VMware Tools en el"
" provisioned images."

#: ../../administration/provisioning/settings.rst:51
msgid "Linux"
msgstr "Linux"

#: ../../administration/provisioning/settings.rst:53
msgid "**USERNAME:** Default user added to Linux Instances during provisioning"
msgstr ""
"**USERNAME:** Predeterminado usuario agregado a Linux Instancias durante "
"aprovisionamiento"

#: ../../administration/provisioning/settings.rst:54
msgid "**PASSWORD:** Password for the Linux user"
msgstr "**PASSWORD:** Contraseña para el Linux usuario"

#: ../../administration/provisioning/settings.rst:55
msgid ""
"**KEYPAIR:** SSH key pair added for the Linux user (select from "
"Infrastructure > Trust > Key Pairs)"
msgstr ""
"**KEYPAIR:** SSH key pair agregado para el Linux usuario (seleccionar "
"desde Infraestructura > Trust > Key Pairs)"

#: ../../administration/provisioning/settings.rst:57
msgid ""
"Either a password, key pair, or both can be configured. Key pairs are "
"managed in Infrastructure > Trust."
msgstr ""
"Either a contraseña, key pair, o both se puede configurar. Key pairs son "
"gestionado en Infraestructura > Trust."

#: ../../administration/provisioning/settings.rst:60
msgid "Windows Settings"
msgstr "Windows Configuración"

#: ../../administration/provisioning/settings.rst:62
msgid ""
"**ADMINISTRATOR PASSWORD:** Default password set for the Windows "
"Administrator account during provisioning"
msgstr ""
"**ADMINISTRATOR PASSWORD:** Predeterminado contraseña establecido para el"
" Windows Administrator cuenta durante aprovisionamiento"

#: ../../administration/provisioning/settings.rst:65
msgid "PXE Boot Settings"
msgstr "PXE Boot Configuración"

#: ../../administration/provisioning/settings.rst:67
msgid ""
"**DEFAULT ROOT PASSWORD:** Password set for root during PXE boot "
"provisioning"
msgstr ""
"**DEFAULT ROOT PASSWORD:** Contraseña establecido para root durante PXE "
"boot aprovisionamiento"

#: ../../administration/provisioning/settings.rst:70
msgid "App Blueprint Settings"
msgstr "App Blueprint Configuración"

#: ../../administration/provisioning/settings.rst:72
msgid "Sets the default Blueprint Type selected when creating new Apps:"
msgstr ""
"Sets el predeterminado Blueprint Tipo seleccionado cuando creando nuevo "
"Apps:"

